t entries	in proffsym.new indicates couple of things I had in mind.Oz-- Usenet: [decvax|allegra|linus|ihnp4]!utzoo!yetti!ozBitnet: oz@[yusol|yuyetti]		In the beginning, there was Word all right, except		it wasn't fixed number of bits.